==History==
2019
*The Earthquake [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 15/4/2019, in the [[Version History#April%202019%20Update%20(15/4/2019)|April 2019 Update]].
*On 3/6/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2019)|Balance Update]], made it so that the Earthquake would appear more often in [[Clan Wars/Clan Wars I|Clan Wars]]. It also added the the Earthquake as a [[Trophies|Trophy Road]] reward, in [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Draft]] and in Mini Collection.
2020
*On 3/3/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/3/2020)|Balance Update]], allowed the Earthquake to affect the [[Tesla]] even if it is hidden.
*On 5/5/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/5/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Earthquake's damage by 11%, but decreased its [[:Category:Building Cards|building]] damage to 200% of its [[:Category:Troop Cards|troop]] damage (from 300%).
*On 2/6/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Earthquake's movement speed debuff to 50% (from 35%), but removed its attack speed and spawn speed debuffs.
*On 31/8/2020, the [[Version History#Clan Wars II Update (31/8/2020)|Clan Wars II Update]], added the Slowdown statistic on the Earthquake's card info screen.
2021
*On 11/2/2021, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (11/2/2021)|maintenance break]], made it so that the Earthquake would only deal 85% of its full troop damage to [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Towers]], but increased its building damage to 250% of its full troop damage (from 200%).
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Earthquake from Jungle Arena to Spooky Town.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 8/4/2022, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (8/4/2022)|maintenance break]], decreased the Earthquake's Crown Tower damage to 65% of the full troop damage (from 85%).
*On 28/4/2022, a maintenance break, added a card render to the Earthquake's card info screen.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 2/10/2024, the [[Version History#Lucky Drops 2.0 Update (2/10/2024)|Lucky Drops 2.0 Update]], made it so that hovering troops would no longer be immune to Earthquake.
2025
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], made it so that [[Lumberjack/Evolution|Lumberjack Ghost]] is immune to Earthquake.
*On 31/3/2024, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Earthquake's damage by 2.43%.
2026

* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Earthquake's Crown Tower damage to 58% of the full troop damage (from 65%)

