==Trivia==
*The Earthquake is 1 of 7 [[:Category:Spell Cards|spells]] which first existed in Clash of Clans, the others being [[Heal]], [[Lightning]], [[Freeze]], [[Poison]], [[Rage]], and [[Clone]].
**In Clash of Clans, the container for Earthquake resemble spells that take up 1 housing space, which is similar to its Clash Royale counterpart.
**Unlike its [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Earthquake_Spell Clash of Clans counterpart], the Earthquake in Clash Royale is able to damage ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]], hits its targets for a specified value, has no damage penalty or bonuses with repeated uses, can affect [[Tesla|Teslas]] that are underground, and slows all affected targets.
*The Earthquake is 1 of 4 [[cards]] associated with subterranea, with the others being [[Goblin Drill]], [[Miner]], and the [[Mighty Miner]].
*In the Korean, Chinese, and Finnish language settings of the game, the Earthquake's name translates to "Earthquake Magic", "Earthquake Spell", and "Tremor" respectively.
*The Earthquake is 1 of 4 damaging spell cards that does not contain the phrase "''Reduced damage to Crown Towers.''" in its description despite dealing reduced damage to [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Towers]], with the others being Goblin Curse, Rage, and [[Tornado]].
*The Earthquake is 1 of 7 spells which have team-colored rings on their radius, the others are Freeze, Poison, Rage, Clone, Tornado, and [[Graveyard]].
*A [[Barbarians|Barbarian]] is featured on the Earthquake's card render.
*It is 1 of 12 cards that is unavailable in [[Chess Royale]], the others being [[Royal Recruits]], [[Rocket]], Lightning, Poison, Goblin Drill, Miner, [[Golden Knight]], [[Skeleton King]], [[Archer Queen]], Mighty Miner, and the [[Monk]].

